# Keep the Docker build context small and free of local build output. Without this,
# host bin/ and obj/ folders were copied into the image build and could shadow the
# restore done inside the container.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
.git/
.github/
.vs/
.vscode/
docs/
marketing-site/
tests/
src/LearnCloud.Web/
**/*.md
.env
.env.*
